    "descriptionPt": "The Beach Samanta Macaquinho is the perfect choice for those who love to combine elegance, lightness and comfort in a single look. Made of high quality polyamide, with zero transparency, it offers impeccable fit and total freedom of movement - ideal for enjoying sunny days with style and tranquility.\n\nThe highlight is due to the beautiful neckline on the back, which adds a delicate and sophisticated touch to the look. In addition, ensuring even more comfort and safety during use.\n\nIts fabric has an extremely soft touch, without compression and with that comfort that embraces, perfect to wear all day. Whether at the beach, after the beach or even in casual moments, the Beach Dress is a versatile piece that suits you - light, sophisticated and always ready for any occasion.\n\nFeel free, beautiful and comfortable wherever you are!\n\nTechnical specifications\n\nSize: One-size-fits-all set - Wears from 38 to 42\n\nComposition: Comfy Polyamide Fabric - 92% Polyamide 8% Elastane\n\nWeight: 260g\n\nWashing instructions: Fabrics in neon and strong colors have low solidity and, therefore, have a greater tendency to release paint on contact with water or sweat. That's why the product may release paint if NEUTRAL SOAP (coconut) and in abundant water is not used; Wash separately from other pieces; Do not soak;\n\nCare: Wash your fitness set before using it, the excess paint comes out on the first wash, because some fabrics receive a high dye content.\n\nRemember:\n\nThe color of the piece may change due to the lighting of the photo and the screen of your device.\n\nAttention: We are not responsible for problems caused during washing.\n\nNote: Attention to the use of the color of the intimate piece. Wear neutral color lingerie, closer to your skin tone and preferably, laser cut (seamless).\n\nModel measurements:\n\nHeight - 1.65 m\n\nBust - 85 cm\n\nWaist - 69 cm\n\nHip - 101 cm",
    "descriptionEn": "The Beach Samanta romper is the perfect choice for those who love to combine elegance, lightness and comfort in a single look. Made of high quality polyamide, with zero transparency, it offers impeccable fit and total freedom of movement - ideal for enjoying sunny days with style and tranquility.\n\nThe highlight is due to the beautiful neckline on the back, which adds a delicate and sophisticated touch to the look. In addition, ensuring even more comfort and safety during use.\n\nIts fabric has an extremely soft touch, without compression and with that comfort that embraces, perfect to wear all day. Whether at the beach, after the beach or even in casual moments, the Beach Dress is a versatile piece that suits you - light, sophisticated and always ready for any occasion.\n\nFeel free, beautiful and comfortable wherever you are!\n\nTechnical specifications\n\nSize: One-size-fits-all set - Wears from 38 to 42\n\nComposition: Comfy Polyamide Fabric - 92% Polyamide 8% Elastane\n\nWeight: 260g\n\nWashing instructions: Fabrics in neon and strong colors have low solidity and, therefore, have a greater tendency to release paint on contact with water or sweat. That's why the product may release paint if NEUTRAL SOAP (coconut) and in abundant water is not used; Wash separately from other pieces; Do not soak;\n\nCare: Wash your fitness set before using it, the excess paint comes out on the first wash, because some fabrics receive a high dye content.\n\nRemember:\n\nThe color of the piece may change due to the lighting of the photo and the screen of your device.\n\nAttention: We are not responsible for problems caused during washing.\n\nNote: Attention to the use of the color of the intimate piece. Wear neutral color lingerie, closer to your skin tone and preferably, laser cut (seamless).\n\nModel measurements:\n\nHeight - 1.65 m\n\nBust - 85 cm\n\nWaist - 69 cm\n\nHip - 101 cm"
