    "descriptionPt": "The Comfy Aline Jumpsuit combines style, comfort, and performance in a flattering, modern design. Crafted from premium polyamide fabric, it provides moderate compression, excellent flexibility, and a comfortable fit that enhances your natural silhouette.\n\nFeaturing delicate thin straps, a stylish cutout below the bust, and double-layered bust fabric for added coverage and support, this jumpsuit offers a feminine and sophisticated look. Its non-see-through fabric provides confidence and comfort throughout the day.\n\nPerfect for workouts, yoga, or casual everyday wear.\n\nProduct Details\n\nFabric: Premium Comfy Polyamide\n\nComposition: 92% Polyamide, 8% Elastane\n\nFabric Weight: 260 GSM\n\nCompression: Moderate\n\nOpacity: Non-see-through\n\nSize: One Size â Fits Brazilian sizes 38â42\n\nCare Instructions\n\nWash separately using mild detergent and plenty of water. Do not soak. Wash before first use, as some fabrics may release excess dye during the initial wash.\n\nPlease Note\n\nProduct colors may vary slightly due to lighting and screen settings. For best results, wear seamless, skin-tone undergarments.",
    "descriptionEn": "The Comfy Aline Jumpsuit combines style, comfort, and performance in a flattering, modern design. Crafted from premium polyamide fabric, it provides moderate compression, excellent flexibility, and a comfortable fit that enhances your natural silhouette.\n\nFeaturing delicate thin straps, a stylish cutout below the bust, and double-layered bust fabric for added coverage and support, this jumpsuit offers a feminine and sophisticated look. Its non-see-through fabric provides confidence and comfort throughout the day.\n\nPerfect for workouts, yoga, or casual everyday wear.\n\nProduct Details\n\nFabric: Premium Comfy Polyamide\n\nComposition: 92% Polyamide, 8% Elastane\n\nFabric Weight: 260 GSM\n\nCompression: Moderate\n\nOpacity: Non-see-through\n\nSize: One Size â Fits Brazilian sizes 38â42\n\nCare Instructions\n\nWash separately using mild detergent and plenty of water. Do not soak. Wash before first use, as some fabrics may release excess dye during the initial wash.\n\nPlease Note\n\nProduct colors may vary slightly due to lighting and screen settings. For best results, wear seamless, skin-tone undergarments."
